dule with alumni events, reunions, campus programming, and athletic contests.","source_url":"https://www.northcentralcollege.edu/homecoming-schedule","source_title":"Homecoming Schedule","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The 2026 schedule lists October 8–11; individual events and registration requirements vary.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"ncc-little-brass-bell","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Battle for the Little Brass Bell","title":"Follow the Little Brass Bell game","subtitle":"Football rivalry during Homecoming","notes":"Catch the designated football rivalry on the official Homecoming schedule and look for the “Battle for the Little Brass Bell” designation.","short_summary":"The Little Brass Bell labels a Homecoming football rivalry game.","evidence_claim":"North Central’s 2026 Homecoming schedule labels its football game against Wheaton College as the Battle for the Little Brass Bell.","source_url":"https://www.northcentralcollege.edu/homecoming-schedule","source_title":"Homecoming Schedule","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The 2026 game is listed for Benedetti-Wehrli Stadium; confirm future opponents and ticket details.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"ncc-cardinal-first-pinning","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Cardinal First Graduation Recognition & Pinning Ceremony","title":"Pass the Cardinal First pin","subtitle":"First-generation graduation recognition","notes":"Eligible first-generation seniors may invite a meaningful faculty or staff mentor to present the Cardinal First pin worn at graduation.","short_summary":"A mentor presents each participating graduate’s pin before commencement.","evidence_claim":"North Cen